# Local dev, backend running on your machine via `dotnet run` (check the actual port in
# split.card.service/src/Split.Card.Api/Properties/launchSettings.json — "applicationUrl",
# use the http:// one, not https://, to avoid the dev cert not being trusted by the app):
#
#   Android emulator + Expo Go: http://10.0.2.2:{port}
#   iOS simulator:              http://localhost:{port}
#   Physical device (Expo Go):  http://{your-machine-LAN-IP}:{port}  (same Wi-Fi as the phone)
#
# Production (Railway):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://splitcard-production.up.railway.app
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:49615
